[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674161810","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103121#issuecomment-2674161810","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103121","id":2674161810,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fZHiS","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T10:26:01Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T10:26:01Z","body":"This PR breaks negative scales since it always assumes a positive scale. \r\n\r\nDo you have an MRP that reproduces the bug? We are generally pretty careful about merging code to fix unreported bugs. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674161810/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674194100","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103121#issuecomment-2674194100","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103121","id":2674194100,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fZPa0","user":{"login":"OhiraKyou","id":7255919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTU5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7255919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou","html_url":"https://github.com/OhiraKyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T10:38:37Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T01:07:17Z","body":"This does not break negative scale, because the minimum value is only applied when scale is equal to `0`. When scale is not `0`, it applies the scale parameter, which retains its existing sign.\r\n\r\nEffectively, this PR is the equivalent of pretending that `sign(0)` returns `1`. It doesn't; it returns `0`, which is why the expression this PR replaces did nothing.\r\n\r\nThere's an MRP in the description (edit: moved to the new associated issue), including steps to reproduce it. I also included previous issues and PRs that attempted to fix the issue. But, those were later replaced by a combination of `sign()`, `max()`, and `abs()` (as seen in the code this PR replaces) that don't actually do anything as a result of `sign()` returning `0` when given 0.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674194100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674204591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103121#issuecomment-2674204591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103121","id":2674204591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fZR-v","user":{"login":"OhiraKyou","id":7255919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTU5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7255919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou","html_url":"https://github.com/OhiraKyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T10:43:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T10:48:03Z","body":"Actually, I do need to change one important thing, though: I forgot to multiply the scale parameter at the end (by returning the scale parameter itself instead of `1`, when it isn't `0`). Will fix.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674204591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674240673","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103121#issuecomment-2674240673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103121","id":2674240673,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fZayh","user":{"login":"OhiraKyou","id":7255919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTU5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7255919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou","html_url":"https://github.com/OhiraKyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T10:57:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T11:41:56Z","body":"Fixed. If the scale is `0`, the transform values are multiplied by a minimum positive value (`0.001`). Otherwise, they are multiplied by the scale (which can be positive or negative).\r\n\r\nFor clarity, the line...\r\n\r\n```glsl\r\nTRANSFORM[0].xyz *= params.scale.x == 0.0 ? 0.001 : params.scale.x;\r\n```\r\n\r\n...is equivalent to...\r\n\r\n\r\n```glsl\r\nif (params.scale.x == 0.0) {\r\n\tTRANSFORM[0].xyz = TRANSFORM[0].xyz * 0.001;\r\n} else {\r\n\tTRANSFORM[0].xyz = TRANSFORM[0].xyz * params.scale.x;\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674240673/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695848539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103121#issuecomment-2695848539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103121","id":2695848539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gr2Jb","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T00:04:41Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T00:04:41Z","body":"Thanks! And congrats for your first merged Godot contribution :tada:","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695848539/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2717593339","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103121#issuecomment-2717593339","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengi